# Nothing in this repo is generated at build time: layout/default-state.json and
# everything under assets/ are committed on purpose (scripts/gen-icon.sh writes
# them deliberately, and the test suites use mktemp outside the tree). So this
# list is only about things that wander in.

# --- install.sh artefacts -------------------------------------------------
# These normally land in ~/.config/hypr, not here. They show up in the tree only
# if someone runs the installer with XDG_CONFIG_HOME pointed at the repo, which
# is exactly the mistake worth not committing.
*.parquet-bak.*
*.tmp.[0-9]*

# --- editor / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.zed/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# --- ad-hoc junk ----------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.orig
*.rej
